   RequestEnterPictureInPicture(gfx.mojom.Size? min_size);
 
+  // Tark: Picture in Picture on leave. Requests the video player to become
+  // the fullscreen element, so the browser's Picture in Picture window shows
+  // only the video. Browser-initiated: the browser waives transient
+  // activation for the fullscreen request the player's frame sends while
+  // handling this, and for no other (WebContentsImpl); the reply ends the
+  // waiver. Players without video ignore it and reply.
